\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get a better look<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5313470\/extras\/145a576bba979198bfd5b79b4478ab43.poster.avif?t=1793723212\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5313470\/extras\/145a576bba979198bfd5b79b4478ab43.webm?t=1793723212\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5313470\/extras\/145a576bba979198bfd5b79b4478ab43.mp4?t=1793723212\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use binoculars to read numbers and eliminate distant targets, or snap a photo with your camera that stays visible for a few seconds. Sometimes, an extra moment to read those digits is all you need.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Capture flags. Rack up eliminations.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5313470\/extras\/fdd9bc60d97339853b2850b8581e1884.poster.avif?t=1793723212\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5313470\/extras\/fdd9bc60d97339853b2850b8581e1884.webm?t=1793723212\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5313470\/extras\/fdd9bc60d97339853b2850b8581e1884.mp4?t=1793723212\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for yourself in Deathmatch, join forces in Team Deathmatch, or push for the enemy flag in Capture the Flag. Make every teammate count in round-based Team Elimination, or outlast everyone in Last Man Standing. Every mode gives you a different reason to get close... and a very good reason to watch your forehead.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bring your friends. Meet your next targets.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5313470\/extras\/25d1cfca98f07dcfc5e669c37e841064.poster.avif?t=1793723212\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5313470\/extras\/25d1cfca98f07dcfc5e669c37e841064.webm?t=1793723212\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5313470\/extras\/25d1cfca98f07dcfc5e669c37e841064.mp4?t=1793723212\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends or strangers in matches with up to 20 players. Face off against your group or team up against the opposition. You might trust your friends, but you probably shouldn’t let them read your number.<\/p>","short_description":"A multiplayer FPS where you eliminate opponents by typing the numbers on their foreheads. Read theirs before they read yours, use tactical gadgets to disrupt the fight, and battle friends or strangers in matches with up to 20 players.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Hungarian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5313470\/2501fdac2bb79ccecc260783360aff70ae781e69\/header.jpg?t=1793723212","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5313470\/4305a7e43a5dd751801fa7895580382ec3a6eb1b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793723212","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5313470\/4305a7e43a5dd7